<header class="header wrap"><a class="brand" href="#"><span class="brand-mark">d<span>n</span>.</span><span class="brand-name">DHANUSH NEHRU<span>ENGINEER / MAKER / EXPLORER</span></span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#journal">Journal</a></nav><a class="header-cta" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dhanushnehru/">Let's connect <span>↗</span></a></header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> THE ART OF THINKING AHEAD</p><h1 id="hero-title">Every move.<br />With <em>intent.</em></h1><p class="intro">I'm Dhanush. I turn complex problems into useful software, then share what I learn along the way.</p><p class="hero-disciplines">ENGINEERING <span>+</span> SECURITY <span>+</span> OPEN SOURCE</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="#work">Explore my work <span>↘</span></a><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/DhanushNehru">GitHub <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-note"><span>♞</span><p>Curiosity is the opening.<br /><strong>Building is the next move.</strong></p></div></div>
<div class="board-panel"><div class="board-top"><span>THE KNIGHT'S PERSPECTIVE</span><span>01 / 64</span></div><div class="board-stage"><div class="board-glow"></div><div id="knight-board" class="chessboard" role="group" aria-label="Interactive knight board. Choose a highlighted square to make a legal knight move.">{Array.from({length:64},(_,i)=>{const rank=8-Math.floor(i/8), file='abcdefgh'[i%8];return <button type="button" class:list={['square',(Math.floor(i/8)+i%8)%2?'dark':'light']} data-square={i} aria-label={`${file}${rank}`}><span class="coord" aria-hidden="true" data-coordinate={i%8===0?rank:i>=56?file:''}></span><span class="piece" aria-hidden="true">{i===42?'♞':''}</span></button>;})}</div></div><div class="board-bottom"><div><span class="tiny-label">YOUR MOVE</span><p id="board-status" aria-live="polite">Knight on c3. Choose a lit square.</p></div><button id="reset-board" type="button" aria-label="Reset knight board">↺</button></div><p class="board-caption">Different paths. Deliberate decisions.</p></div></section>
<div class="ticker" aria-label="Areas of interest"><div class="wrap"><span>BUILD WITH CURIOSITY</span><span>♜</span><span>THINK IN SYSTEMS</span><span>♞</span><span>SHARE THE PLAYBOOK</span><span>♝</span><span>KEEP EXPLORING</span></div></div>
<section id="work" class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / SELECTED MOVES</p><h2>Ideas into <em>impact.</em></h2></div><p>A few things I've put into the world.<br />Open source. Built to be explored.</p></div><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter projects"><button type="button" data-filter="All" aria-pressed="true">All work <span>04</span></button><button type="button" data-filter="Security" aria-pressed="false">Security</button><button type="button" data-filter="AI" aria-pressed="false">AI</button><button type="button" data-filter="Web" aria-pressed="false">Web</button></div><p class="sr-only" id="filter-status" aria-live="polite">Showing all 4 projects</p><div class="project-grid">{projects.map(p=><article class="project" data-category={p.cat}><div class="project-top"><span>{p.no} / {p.cat.toUpperCase()}</span><span class="project-piece" aria-hidden="true">{p.piece}</span></div><div class="project-art" aria-hidden="true">{p.name==='lockcheck'?<><span class="code-line">$ npx @dhanushnehru/lockcheck</span><span><i>✓</i> Review the dependencies.</span><span><i>✓</i> Know what changed.</span><span class="terminal-cursor">_</span></>:p.name==='TachyRoute'?<div class="routes"><span>INPUT</span><b>↗</b><span>DECIDE</span><b>↘</b><span>EVIDENCE</span></div>:p.name==='agentcheck'?<div class="scanner"><span>AGENTS.md</span><div></div><span>LOOK BEYOND THE VISIBLE.</span></div>:<div class="transfer"><span>DEVICE A</span><b>⇄</b><span>DEVICE B</span></div>}</div><p class="project-tag">{p.tag}</p><h3><a href={p.url}>{p.name} <span>↗</span></a></h3><p>{p.desc}</p><details><summary>The thinking behind it <span>+</span></summary><p>{p.detail}</p></details><div class="project-foot"><span>{p.tech}</span><a href={p.url} aria-label={`Explore source for ${p.name} on GitHub`}>Explore source ↗</a></div></article>)}</div><a class="all-projects" href="https://github.com/DhanushNehru?tab=repositories">There's more on the board. <strong>Explore all repositories ↗</strong></a></section>
<section id="about" class="about-section"><div class="wrap about-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / BEHIND THE MOVES</p><h2>A builder's mind.<br /><em>A player's curiosity.</em></h2><p class="about-intro">I like understanding how things work. And finding out how they could work better.</p><p>My work spans software engineering, cybersecurity, DevSecOps and open-source tools. I write about technology, make videos and learn by building in public.</p><p>Beyond the keyboard: chess, piano, mouth organ, dance and solving cubes. Different ways to keep the mind moving.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/DhanushNehru">Meet me on GitHub ↗</a></div><div class="playbook"><div class="playbook-head"><span>THE PERSONAL PLAYBOOK</span><span>♚</span></div><div class="playbook-row"><span>01</span><div><h3>Build useful things.</h3><p>Security tools, AI experiments and web experiences that start with a real problem.</p></div></div><div class="playbook-row"><span>02</span><div><h3>Leave knowledge open.</h3><p>Source code, technical writing and video. A useful discovery is worth sharing.</p></div></div><div class="playbook-row"><span>03</span><div><h3>Stay a student.</h3><p>Keep asking why. Try a different angle. Make the next version better.</p></div></div><div class="recognition"><span>FEATURED ON MY GITHUB PROFILE</span><p>AWS Community Builder <span>↗</span><br />Burp Suite Champion</p><a href="https://github.com/DhanushNehru#readme">View profile & badges ↗</a></div></div></div></section>
<section id="journal" class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / THE ANALYSIS ROOM</p><h2>Notes from <em>the game.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="https://blog.dhanushnehru.got-a.page/">Visit the journal ↗</a></div><div class="article-list">{articles.length?articles.map((a,i)=><a class="article" href={a.link}><span class="article-number">0{i+1}</span><div><span class="tiny-label">{a.date.toLocaleDateString('en-US',{month:'short',day:'numeric',year:'numeric'})} / WRITING</span><h3>{a.title}</h3></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>):<a class="article" href="https://blog.dhanushnehru.got-a.page/"><span class="article-number">01</span><div><span class="tiny-label">TECHNOLOGY / SECURITY / IDEAS</span><h3>Read my latest essays on the journal.</h3></div><span>↗</span></a>}</div><div class="video-heading"><h3>Prefer to watch?</h3><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@dhanushnehru">The Curious Guy on YouTube ↗</a></div><div class="videos">{videos.length?videos.map(v=><a class="video" href={v.link}><span class="play" aria-hidden="true">▶</span><div><span class="tiny-label">VIDEO / THE CURIOUS GUY</span><h3>{v.title}</h3></div><span>↗</span></a>):<a class="video" href="https://www.youtube.com/@dhanushnehru"><span class="play" aria-hidden="true">▶</span><div><span class="tiny-label">THE CURIOUS GUY</span><h3>Technology, explained with curiosity.</h3></div><span>↗</span></a>}</div></section>
